ts are booked through the facilities portal.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"slot is 45 minutes long.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states the 45-minute slot length, and source A matches it.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Vehicles over 7.5 tonnes need two consecutive slots.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly, and source A agrees.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the portal will not let you book them separately.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states that the portal will not allow the two consecutive slots to be booked separately.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Slots open 14 days ahead and close 4 hours before the slot starts.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Both sources state that slots open 14 days ahead.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Slots open 14 days ahead and close 4 hours before the slot starts.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Both sources state that slots close 4 hours before the slot starts.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"There is no\\nsame-hour booking.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states that there is no same-hour booking.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The dock booking phone line was retired\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this, but source B conflicts with it by describing an active booking line on extension 2140, and the claim does not report that disagreement.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the number no longer connects\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this, but source B conflicts with it by telling users to call extension 2140 when the portal is down.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"All\\nbookings go through the portal.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this, but source B conflicts with it by allowing phone requests when the portal is down.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Drivers who call the old number hear a recorded\\nmessage pointing them at the portal.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly, although source B describes the phone line as still in use.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Drivers report to the gatehouse with the booking reference.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly, and source B agrees.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The gatehouse checks\\nthe reference against the day sheet\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states that the gatehouse checks the reference against the day sheet.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"directs the vehicle to a bay\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states that the gatehouse directs the vehicle to a bay.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A driver\\nwithout a reference waits in the holding area until a slot is free.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this in full, including the condition 'until a slot is free'.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A vehicle still on the bay 15 minutes after its slot ends is logged as an\\noverrun.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Both sources state this, and the span is quoted from source B.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-018\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Three overruns in a quarter and the supplier is asked to rebook through\\ntheir account manager.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly.\"}]}","ttft_ms":11094,"type":"result","duration_ms":22266,"uuid":"4e8540d9-b25f-4401-8823-e04ad5e7dc93","ttft_stream_ms":1414,"time_to_request_ms":94,"first_content_frame_ms":1415,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
